# 🔐 Simple Password Manager

A beginner-friendly Python console application to manage your passwords using file handling.

## ✨ Features
- Add new credentials (site, username, password)
- View all saved credentials
- Delete credentials by site name
- Stores data in a simple text file (`passwords.txt`)

## 🛠️ How to Run
1. Clone this repository:
   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/your-username/password-manager.git
